          "id": "02.03.03-S026",
          "text": "要不要提前半小时见？",
          "meaning_my": "နာရီဝက် စောပြီး တွေ့ကြမလား။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "02.03.04",
      "title": "到达碰面和接送",
      "title_my": "ရောက်ရှိခြင်း၊ တွေ့ဆုံခြင်းနှင့် ကြိုပို့ခြင်း",
      "original_count": 20,
      "added_count": 13,
      "phrase_count": 33,
      "phrases": [
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S001",
          "text": "我到了。",
          "meaning_my": "ရောက်ပြီ။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S002",
          "text": "我来接你。",
          "meaning_my": "လာကြိုပေးမယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S003",
          "text": "不用接，我自己过去。",
          "meaning_my": "လာကြိုစရာ မလိုဘူး၊ ကိုယ်တိုင် သွားလိုက်မယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S004",
          "text": "我在门口等你。",
          "meaning_my": "တံခါးဝမှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S005",
          "text": "你出来一下。",
          "meaning_my": "အပြင်ကို ခဏထွက်လာပါဦး။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S006",
          "text": "你在站里还是站外？",
          "meaning_my": "ဘူတာအထဲမှာလား၊ အပြင်မှာလား။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S007",
          "text": "你到门口给我打电话。",
          "meaning_my": "တံခါးဝရောက်ရင် ဖုန်းဆက်ပါ။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S008",
          "text": "你能看到我吗？",
          "meaning_my": "ဒီမှာ ရှိနေတာ မြင်ရလား။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S009",
          "text": "我把位置发给你。",
          "meaning_my": "တည်နေရာ ပို့ပေးမယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S010",
          "text": "我在车里等你。",
          "meaning_my": "ကားထဲမှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S011",
          "text": "我在一楼大厅等你。",
          "meaning_my": "မြေညီထပ် ဧည့်ခန်းမမှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S012",
          "text": "我马上到。",
          "meaning_my": "ရောက်တော့မယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S013",
          "text": "我还在地铁站里。",
          "meaning_my": "မြေအောက်ရထားဘူတာထဲမှာပဲ ရှိသေးတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S014",
          "text": "你先找个地方坐一下。",
          "meaning_my": "အရင် ထိုင်စောင့်နေပါဦး။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S015",
          "text": "你不用特意跑一趟。",
          "meaning_my": "တကူးတက လာစရာ မလိုဘူး။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S016",
          "text": "我自己回去。",
          "meaning_my": "ကိုယ်တိုင် ပြန်လိုက်မယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S017",
          "text": "我看到你了。",
          "meaning_my": "မြင်ပြီ။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S018",
          "text": "你往前走一点。",
          "meaning_my": "ရှေ့ကို နည်းနည်း လျှောက်လာပါ။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S019",
          "text": "我在路边等你。",
          "meaning_my": "လမ်းဘေးမှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S020",
          "text": "我马上出来。",
          "meaning_my": "အခုထွက်လာတော့မယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S021",
          "text": "你到了吗？",
          "meaning_my": "ရောက်ပြီလား။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S022",
          "text": "我刚到。",
          "meaning_my": "အခုမှ ရောက်တာ။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S023",
          "text": "我没看到你。",
          "meaning_my": "ခင်ဗျားကို မမြင်ရသေးဘူး။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S024",
          "text": "我在你后面。",
          "meaning_my": "ခင်ဗျား နောက်မှာ ရှိတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S025",
          "text": "你从哪个出口出来？",
          "meaning_my": "ဘယ်ထွက်ပေါက်က ထွက်လာတာလဲ။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S026",
          "text": "我在停车场。",
          "meaning_my": "ကားပါကင်မှာ ရှိတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S027",
          "text": "找不到停车位。",
          "meaning_my": "ကားရပ်ဖို့ နေရာ ရှာမတွေ့ဘူး။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S028",
          "text": "我把车停在路边了。",
          "meaning_my": "ကားကို လမ်းဘေးမှာ ရပ်ထားတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S029",
          "text": "上车吧。",
          "meaning_my": "ကားပေါ် တက်လိုက်ပါ။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S030",
          "text": "我送你回去。",
          "meaning_my": "ပြန်လိုက်ပို့ပေးမယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S031",
          "text": "不用送，我打车回去。",
          "meaning_my": "လိုက်ပို့စရာ မလိုဘူး၊ တက္ကစီစီးပြီး ပြန်မယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S032",
          "text": "路上堵车，可能晚点到。",
          "meaning_my": "လမ်းမှာ ကားပိတ်နေလို့ နည်းနည်း နောက်ကျမှ ရောက်နိုင်တယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "02.03.04-S033",
          "text": "你先吃，不用等我。",
          "meaning_my": "အရင်စားနှင့်ပါ၊ စောင့်စရာ မလိုဘူး။",
          "replies": [],
